@startuml holder-credential-flow
title Credential Holder Using did:key - Complete Flow

actor Holder as holder
participant "EUDI Wallet" as wallet
participant "Issuer" as issuer
participant "Verifier" as verifier

== Key Generation ==
holder -> wallet: Install app
activate wallet
wallet -> wallet: Generate P-256 key pair
note right: Uses @noble/curves\nSecurely stored in Keychain/Keystore
wallet -> wallet: Create did:key identifier
note right: did:key:z6MkhaXgBZDvot...\nClient-side, instant, no registration
wallet -> wallet: Store public key as JWK
deactivate wallet

== Credential Issuance ==
holder -> issuer: Scan credential QR code
activate issuer
issuer -> issuer: Create credential offer
issuer --> wallet: Credential offer URI
deactivate issuer

wallet -> wallet: Parse credential offer
wallet -> issuer: Fetch issuer metadata
activate issuer
issuer --> wallet: Metadata (supported credentials, endpoints)
deactivate issuer

wallet -> wallet: Generate PKCE challenge
note right: S256: code_verifier + SHA-256\nProtects against code interception

wallet -> wallet: Create Proof of Possession JWT
note right: Signed with private key\nproves holder controls key

wallet -> issuer: Authorization request (with PKCE)
activate issuer
issuer -> holder: Request user authentication
holder -> issuer: Authenticate (e.g., Cl@ve)
issuer --> wallet: Authorization code
deactivate issuer

wallet -> issuer: Token exchange (with PKCE verifier)
activate issuer
issuer -> issuer: Verify PKCE challenge
issuer --> wallet: Access token
deactivate issuer

wallet -> issuer: Credential request (with PoP JWT)
activate issuer
issuer -> issuer: Verify PoP JWT signature\nusing public key from did:key
issuer -> issuer: Issue credential (SD-JWT)
issuer --> wallet: SD-JWT credential
deactivate issuer

wallet -> wallet: Store credential locally
note right: Encrypted in credential store\nLinked to holder did:key

== Credential Presentation ==
holder -> verifier: Present credential (e.g., age verification)
activate verifier
verifier -> verifier: Create presentation request
note right: Specifies which fields needed\nincluding nonce for replay protection
verifier --> wallet: Presentation request JWT
deactivate verifier

wallet -> wallet: Evaluate presentation definition
note right: Which credentials match?\nWhich fields requested?

wallet -> wallet: Select matching credential
wallet -> wallet: Filter selective disclosure
note right: Only include requested fields\nMinimize data exposure

wallet -> wallet: Create Key Binding JWT
note right: Signed with private key\nProves holder has key\nBinds to SD-JWT via sd_hash\nIncludes nonce (replay protection)

wallet -> verifier: VP Token (JWT + disclosures + KB-JWT)
activate verifier
verifier -> verifier: Parse presentation
verifier -> verifier: Resolve holder did:key\nfrom JWT header
note right: Extract public key\nNo network call needed

verifier -> verifier: Verify signatures\n(KB-JWT and original credential)
verifier -> verifier: Verify nonce matches\nreplay protection
verifier -> verifier: Validate disclosure hashes
note right: Verify revealed claims\nmatch disclosed values

verifier -> verifier: Access granted
note right: Age verified\nNo birthdate leaked
note right: Privacy preserved!\nVerifier only sees age claim
verifier --> holder: Success (e.g., access granted)
deactivate verifier

@enduml
